0,Itonama language - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Itonama_language,Itonama is an extinct language isolate once spoken by the Itonama people in the Amazonian lowlands of north-eastern Bolivia. It was spoken on the Itonomas River and Lake in Beni Department.,Itonama,Language isolate
