2,Itonama language,https://grokipedia.com/page/itonama_language,"Itonama is a dormant language isolate formerly spoken by the Itonama people in the northeastern Bolivian Amazon, particularly in the Beni department along the Itonama and Magdalena rivers.",Itonama,Language isolate
